    {
      "id": "claim_9f1bc15815c74e8a9da189db2f2e5a04",
      "statement": "The workflow checks out only the trusted base ref (never the PR head) and passes PR-controlled values such as the title via env vars rather than interpolating them into run scripts, to avoid expression injection while holding a write token.",
