    {
      "id": "claim_527479989d664d38bf403258ad1100db",
      "statement": "The run-state step iterates every changed specs/<slug>/SUMMARY.md that has a RUN.json, attempts run_state.py transition --to shipped --event ci.merged with the merge SHA, stops at the first success, publishes the slug output only on success, and is non-fatal when no candidate transitions.",
